          "feedback_id": "T7-fit_on_train_only",
          "correction": "Change preprocessing.fit_on from 'all_data' to 'train_only'. The encoder and scaler must be fitted exclusively on the training partition, then applied to test data, to prevent leaking training statistics into test-set preprocessing."
